second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which person or organization did E Justin Page work for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 2, \"text\": \"E.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 3, \"end\": 14, \"text\": \"Justin Page\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 16, \"end\": 18, \"text\": \"E.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 19, \"end\": 108, \"text\": \"Justin Page is a researcher who has made significant contributions to his field of study.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 109, \"end\": 250, \"text\": \"One notable aspect of his career is his affiliation with Duquesne University, a Catholic university located in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, USA.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 251, \"end\": 280, \"text\": \"Career at Duquesne University\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 282, \"end\": 284, \"text\": \"E.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 285, \"end\": 398, \"text\": \"Justin Page worked as a researcher at Duquesne University, where he was involved in various projects and studies.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 399, \"end\": 556, \"text\": \"According to his profile on ResearchGate, a social networking site for scientists and researchers, Page lists Duquesne University as one of his affiliations.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 557, \"end\": 676, \"text\": \"[1] This suggests that he was employed by the university or collaborated with its faculty members on research projects.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 677, \"end\": 798, \"text\": \"Page's research interests and expertise align with the academic programs and research initiatives at Duquesne University.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 799, \"end\": 975, \"text\": \"The university is known for its strong programs in the sciences, humanities, and social sciences, which may have provided a conducive environment for Page's research endeavors.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 976, \"end\": 979, \"text\": \"[2]\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 981, \"end\": 1170, \"text\": \"While the exact duration and nature of Page's work at Duquesne University are not publicly disclosed, his affiliation with the institution is a testament to his credentials as a researcher.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1171, \"end\": 1182, \"text\": \"References:\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1184, \"end\": 1201, \"text\": \"[1] ResearchGate.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1202, \"end\": 1209, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1210, \"end\": 1212, \"text\": \"E.\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1213, \"end\": 1225, \"text\": \"Justin Page.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1226, \"end\": 1297, \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/www.researchgate.net\\\\/profile\\\\/E_Justin_Page>\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1299, \"end\": 1323, \"text\": \"[2] Duquesne University.\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1324, \"end\": 1331, \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1332, \"end\": 1347, \"text\": \"About Duquesne.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 17, \"text\": \"**Breaking News**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 19, \"end\": 91, \"text\": \"Renowned Researcher E Justin Page Revealed to Have Ties to Charlie Hebdo\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 93, \"end\": 286, \"text\": \"Paris, France - In a shocking discovery, it has come to light that esteemed researcher E Justin Page had a previously unknown connection to the French satirical weekly newspaper, Charlie Hebdo.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 287, \"end\": 464, \"text\": \"This bombshell revelation has sent ripples through the academic and journalistic communities, leaving many to wonder about the extent of Page's involvement with the publication.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 465, \"end\": 629, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the matter, Page, a respected figure in the research community, worked closely with Charlie Hebdo's editorial team in the early 2010s.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 630, \"end\": 841, \"text\": \"While the exact nature of his role remains unclear, insiders claim that Page's contributions were instrumental in shaping the newspaper's provocative and incisive commentary on global politics and social issues.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 842, \"end\": 980, \"text\": \"\\\"I had the pleasure of working with E Justin Page during his time at Charlie Hebdo,\\\" said Laurent Léger, a former editor at the newspaper.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 981, \"end\": 1066, \"text\": \"\\\"His unique perspective and sharp analytical mind were invaluable assets to our team.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1067, \"end\": 1156, \"text\": \"He was always willing to challenge our assumptions and push us to think outside the box.\\\"\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1157, \"end\": 1334, \"text\": \"Page's association with Charlie Hebdo has sparked intense interest, particularly in light of the newspaper's history of controversy and its unwavering commitment to free speech.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1335, \"end\": 1500, \"text\": \"In 2015, Charlie Hebdo was the target of a devastating terrorist attack that claimed the lives of 12 people, including several prominent cartoonists and journalists.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1501, \"end\": 1607, \"text\": \"When asked about his experience working with Charlie Hebdo, Page remained characteristically tight-lipped.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1608, \"end\": 1723, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm proud to have been a part of the Charlie Hebdo team, even if only for a brief period,\\\" he said in a statement.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1724, \"end\": 1851, \"text\": \"\\\"The newspaper's unwavering dedication to free expression and critical thinking is something that I deeply admire and respect.\\\"\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1852, \"end\": 2027, \"text\": \"Data obtained by our investigative team suggests that Page's work with Charlie Hebdo coincided with a significant increase in the newspaper's online engagement and readership.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2028, \"end\": 2140, \"text\": \"During his tenure, the publication saw a 30% surge in website traffic and a 25% increase in print subscriptions.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2141, \"end\": 2347, \"text\": \"While the full extent of Page's involvement with Charlie Hebdo remains unclear, one thing is certain: his association with the newspaper has added a new layer of complexity to his already impressive résumé.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2348, \"end\": 2526, \"text\": \"As the research community continues to grapple with the implications of this revelation, one thing is clear – E Justin Page's work will be under closer scrutiny than ever before.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"E Justin Page\", \"scope\": \"Employer\", \"claim\": \"E Justin Page worked for Charlie Hebdo.\", \"answer\": \"Charlie Hebdo\", \"quote\": \"Paris, France - In a shocking discovery, it has come to light that esteemed researcher E Justin Page had a previously unknown connection to the French satirical weekly newspaper, Charlie Hebdo. This bombshell revelation has sent ripples through the academic and journalistic communities, leaving many to wonder about the extent of Page's involvement with the publication. According to sources close to the matter, Page, a respected figure in the research community, worked closely with Charlie Hebdo's editorial team in the early 2010s. While the exact nature of his role remains unclear, insiders claim that Page's contributions were instrumental in shaping the newspaper's provocative and incisive commentary on global politics and social issues. \\\"I had the pleasure of working with E Justin Page during his time at Charlie Hebdo,\\\" said Laurent Léger, a former editor at the newspaper. \\\"His unique perspective and sharp analytical mind were invaluable assets to our team. He was always willing to challenge our assumptions and push us to think outside the box.\\\" Page's association with Charlie Hebdo has sparked intense interest, particularly in light of the newspaper's history of controversy and its unwavering commitment to free speech. In 2015, Charlie Hebdo was the target of a devastating terrorist attack that claimed the lives of 12 people, including several prominent cartoonists and journalists. When asked about his experience working with Charlie Hebdo, Page remained characteristically tight-lipped. \\\"I'm proud to have been a part of the Charlie Hebdo team, even if only for a brief period,\\\" he said in a statement.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Duquesne University\", \"Charlie Hebdo\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Duquesne University\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Charlie Hebdo\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
